nt/KKT certificate. The fully connected optimizer seam is R ≤ J + B + K + W + M. This remains conditional until concrete objective, feasible-set, oracle, stationarity, and shared-state witnesses are kernel-checked.\",\n    \"maxwell_scope\": \"The physics graph uses carrier-polymorphic exact differential-form Maxwell/Hodge-Maxwell semantics. A finite GRU representation is a special-case representation theorem; no universal continuous-PDE representation is inferred without explicit function-space/domain/metric/source/boundary semantics and exact encode/decode plus transition conjugacy.\"\n  },\n  \"pregraphed_candidates\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"CanonicalEndogenousAutomataSignOptimizerAffineGRUExpressivityTopologyNeighborhoodConjugacyCandidate\",\n      \"status\": \"CANDIDATE_NOT_PROVED\",\n      \"parent\": \"CanonicalFullLearnerConnectedScanConjugacyTheorem\",\n      \"path\": [\n        \"CanonicalFullLearnerConnectedScanConjugacyTheorem\",\n        \"DirectProductFiniteAutomatonComposition\",\n        \"DenseNeighborhoodSeparationTheorem\",\n        \"FullCommutingSquareConjugacyTheorem\"\n      ],\n      \"distinction\": \"Automata-backed sign-optimizer-affine candidate. It is deliberately separate from the existing non-automata and non-tropical candidates while remaining inside the strict fully connected graph.\",\n      \"promotion_gate\": \"Promote only after an Agda witness proves sign/optimizer-affine preservation, finite-automaton realization, transition compatibility, exact GRU conjugacy, same-witness neighborhood separation, topology compatibility, inclusion, and baseline nonrepresentability.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"ConnectedJensenMinimaxRegretRoundingKKTMarkovTheorem\",\n      \"status\": \"CANDIDATE_NOT_PROVED\",\n      \"parent\": \"CanonicalFullLearnerConnectedScanConjugacyTheorem\",\n      \"path\": [\n        \"CanonicalFullLearnerConnectedScanConjugacyTheorem\",\n        \"RecurrentAssociativeScanTheorem\",\n        \"MarkovStati